SUMMARY:13th annual Gardens Got Natives Tour
DESCRIPTION:The Gardens Got Natives tour is a free event featuring forty plus California native plant home\, business\, and school gardens in the Sacramento region. We not only have a new name this year but have increased the tour to two days. Not all gardens will be open on both days. The tour brochure will be color coded to help navigate the new two day format. We will again have several vendors Mother Natives\, Find Out Farms\, and Miridae Mobile Nursery for purchasing plants on the tour days. Details of locations will be posted as that information becomes available.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/13th-annual-gardens-got-natives-tour/
