SUMMARY:Beitna: A Gathering for Arab Heritage\, Culture and Solidarity
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday April 19\, 2026 from 1:30 to 5:30 PM for Arab American Heritage Month at Beitna: A Gathering for Arab Heritage\, Culture\, and Solidarity. Beitna\, meaning “our house” in Arabic\, offers art displays\, cultural performances\, poetry readings\, food\, and crafts\, highlighting the richness of Arab culture. It’s a chance to connect\, learn\, and engage with Arab heritage while fostering community\, solidarity and cultural pride. \n  \nEntrance is free. Please RSVP at tinyurl.com/beitnadavis2026.
